  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into rounds.\n• Cut sweet potato and beetroot into small chunks.\n• Cut brown onion into thick wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678474d2f2efe8ce60991635-f02a1b40.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678474d2f2efe8ce60991635-b89be3bd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain and cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Cook in batches for best results.\n• In last minute of cook time, add honey, turning haloumi to coat.\n• To tray with roasted veggies, add mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of the white wine vinegar. Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678474d2f2efe8ce60991635-c7d29f5d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie salad between bowls.\n• Top with haloumi.\n• Drizzle over garlic aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678474d2f2efe8ce60991635-e994bb84.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
